@startuml
title UC2 - Conduct Consultation (Failure Scenario)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Administrative Staff" as Admin
participant "Appointment Tracking System" as System

Admin -> System: getAppointmentDetails(appointmentID)
System --> Admin: appointmentDetails

Admin -> System: recordClinicalInformation(\nconsultationID, observations, diagnoses,\ntreatmentRecommendations, followUpRequirements)

System --> Admin: accessDenied,\ninsufficientPermissions

note right of System
  Administrative staff are not
  authorized to modify
  clinical information.

  No ClinicalRecord is
  created or modified.
end note

@enduml


